  "summary_text": "Flaky integration tests and linting rules and canary setup\nSuggestion to clean up the backlog before touching flaky integration tests\nFeedback on linting rules from the new folks: they pushed back a bit\nCanary setup is way overdue\nPreference to clean up the backlog rather than loop in the other team\nProcess and incident review and doc\nProcess: it's not as bad as it sounded\nNotes on incident review added to the doc\nDoc is on the critical path\nProgress updates\nSlipped: write the Falcon cutover script (Sam, now due Friday)\nDone: set up the device lab for Otter (Ruth)\nDone: finish the backend job description (Alex)\nNext steps\nKofi to backfill the Lighthouse events table by Friday\nSam to speed up the invoice export by Thursday\nInês to cut the Android release build by Friday",
  "summary_markdown": "### Flaky integration tests and linting rules and canary setup\n- Suggestion to clean up the backlog before touching flaky integration tests\n- Feedback on linting rules from the new folks: they pushed back a bit\n- Canary setup is way overdue\n- Preference to clean up the backlog rather than loop in the other team\n\n### Process and incident review and doc\n- Process: it's not as bad as it sounded\n- Notes on incident review added to the doc\n- Doc is on the critical path\n\n### Progress updates\n- **Slipped:** write the Falcon cutover script (Sam, now due Friday)\n- **Done:** set up the device lab for Otter (Ruth)\n- **Done:** finish the backend job description (Alex)\n\n### Next steps\n- Kofi to backfill the Lighthouse events table by **Friday**\n- Sam to speed up the invoice export by **Thursday**\n- Inês to cut the Android release build by **Friday**",
  "private_notes_text": "slipped add idempotency keys to the webhook handler\ninês to cut the android release build by",
  "private_notes_markdown": "slipped add idempotency keys to the webhook handler\ninês to cut the android release build by",
